sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI agent
    participant API as Paid API
    participant Policy as Spend policy
    participant Hedera as Hedera
    participant Mirror as Mirror Node
    participant HCS as HCS audit

    Agent->>API: Request resource
    API-->>Agent: HTTP 402 challenge
    Agent->>Policy: Check merchant and budget
    Policy-->>Agent: Approved
    Agent->>Hedera: Pay native HBAR
    Agent->>API: Retry with payment evidence
    API->>Mirror: Verify receipt and challenge binding
    Mirror-->>API: Valid payment
    API-->>Agent: Purchased response
    Agent->>HCS: Record activity
